# ── Privacy by construction ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo ships the FRAMEWORK, not data. Everything a team member adds to
# the content folders stays local. Only each folder's README.md is tracked,
# so the structure survives a fork while confidential RFI material cannot be
# pushed to a public fork by accident.
#
# Pattern note: to keep a README inside an otherwise-ignored folder, we ignore
# the folder's contents, then re-include the nested folder and its README.

# Team-confidential OEM disclosure notes — the OEM-disclosure-notes.md file (a
# capability delivered by another vendor and the approved disclosure wording).
# NEVER tracked; seeded from the restricted team drive. The glob is name-agnostic,
# so any variant (including a vendor-prefixed name) is ignored too, and no vendor
# name ever needs to appear in this tracked file.
#
# The *.EXAMPLE.md templates alongside these paths ARE tracked and ship with the
# repo — they carry structure only, never real names or arrangements. Copy an
# example to the real filename to start; the copy lands on an ignored path.
knowledge-base/*disclosure-notes.md
!knowledge-base/*disclosure-notes.EXAMPLE.md

# Team-confidential PM roster — who owns which product area, used to route open
# questions in general Q&A (Mode B). Contains colleagues' names and contact details,
# so it never belongs in a public repo. Seeded locally; see SETUP-INSTRUCTIONS.md.
knowledge-base/pm-roster.md
!knowledge-base/pm-roster.EXAMPLE.md

# knowledge-base/references/ (and its roadmap/ subfolder)
knowledge-base/references/*
!knowledge-base/references/README.md
!knowledge-base/references/roadmap/
knowledge-base/references/roadmap/*
!knowledge-base/references/roadmap/README.md

# knowledge-base/previous-RFIs/ (and its latest-RFI/ subfolder)
knowledge-base/previous-RFIs/*
!knowledge-base/previous-RFIs/README.md
!knowledge-base/previous-RFIs/latest-RFI/
knowledge-base/previous-RFIs/latest-RFI/*
!knowledge-base/previous-RFIs/latest-RFI/README.md

# outputs/ (and its blank-current-RFI/ subfolder)
outputs/*
!outputs/README.md
!outputs/blank-current-RFI/
outputs/blank-current-RFI/*
!outputs/blank-current-RFI/README.md

# ── OS / editor / tooling cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# Local Claude Code settings (keep CLAUDE.md, ignore machine-local state)
.claude/settings.local.json
